<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian drones are now conducting operations in Sudan while RSF drones launch from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting reciprocal diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. In northern Ethiopia, an RPG strike near a school in Moyale killed dozens of Ethiopian Orthodox believers and a Kenyan, leading to additional police deployment and security talks. Attacks on Orthodox Christians continue in Arsi, Benishangul Gumuz and the north, and blasts have been heard in Addis Ababa. Seed insecurity threatens Tigray farmers and a psychosocial and spiritual care pilot is being tested. The war caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;New Business Ethiopia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTFBObkJ0dm9QMTl6R294dFltZ2tQUVl4SHV2elB5VEw0UFdGNDl1VTU0d3VGZXlOTEVFelRXdE4xdHJpcFF4ZGpnc29HTDRUMDZ6QkdhREVydlNXU0lnZmw3czMtY2ptUlF2Q3RjeUdoMkJFWFNIbE9Jdg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Legis1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTFBOZmhydEVrRWc4SXktTG1yVzdBVlVleUNqTlNuRUJib2ZnY3VLQzRSY080bXFFdExXZ3ZWelhxWEJWVXFmT2ZublRmdTVYMUpnTF9Pbl9rZExndmFRak5oMDRKcy1iM0ZJVHBN?oc=5&quot;&gt;allAfrica.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQbUttZjJ3eS05MUV5UnZ5QkV6cUlrWjl2OXhCZ3NIYmxFbDlUenNRRE5jYXdNNXVYbkdQM1J2WmlEVDB0aEZFVzdfRUtxdloyVVlXRGNWVkNIYXVGSERTR1V1SmZqbXRuSGxvT1QxMXQ2eGk5bzVBazJZT21qREVRX2xRRFVOdndmdmZucTM5M0s1b1VJNHZiSTNhZi1XTjgwR0xoZ2pLZFpQTFFQb3R3NHRObw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bioengineer.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPZGV4MmJOU3pjSFBTcUtvSnVIVTUyT0JHRHRkSUNFU2E2RmpBQWJCejNMdGNlSGR6TjFaaVJ3b1BmVWZTN0k0NHB5QmFFZVBh